('2101143295848616028','搊','1','biān','扌','12',NULL,'[{"def": "搊", "example": null}, {"def": "搏", "example": null}, {"def": "搊,搏也。从手,扁声。--《说文》", "example": null}, {"def": "搊", "example": null}, {"def": "扁形的", "example": null}, {"def": "五百搊刀飞入江,滚牌所至指可掬。--清·全祖望《圣清戎乐词》", "example": null}, {"def": "搊biān 1.击。参见\\"搊刀\\"。", "example": null}]','chinese-xinhua','0'),
